<a class="vacancy-card" href="#director">
    <span class="vacancy-label">Vacancy</span>
    <strong>We&rsquo;re searching for a new Director!</strong>
    <span class="vacancy-more">Find out more ↓</span>
</a>

<section class="home-block">
    <h1>About Sanderstead Singers</h1>
    <p>Sanderstead Singers is a Cathedral visiting choir with its roots in Sanderstead, Surrey, but its singers are now gathered from across the country. Each year we spend a week as the visiting choir at a cathedral, singing the daily services. We also sing at one-off services during the year.</p>
    <p class="actions">
        <a class="button" href="/visits/">See where we&rsquo;ve sung</a>
        <a class="button button-secondary" href="/contact/">Contact us</a>
    </p>
</section>

{% include "partials/upcoming.njk" %}

<section class="stats">
    Singing together since 1991
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Recent visits</h2>
    <ul class="recent-visits">
    {%- for visit in collections.visits | confirmed | limit(4) %}
        <li>
            <a href="{{ visit.url }}">
                {%- set photo = visit.data.image or (cathedralImages[visit.data.cathedral] or {}).src %}
                {%- if photo %}<img src="{{ photo }}" alt="" loading="lazy">{% else %}<div class="placeholder" aria-hidden="true">{{ visit.data.cathedral | first }}</div>{% endif %}
                <span class="name">{{ visit.data.cathedral | smart }}</span>
                <span class="date">{{ visit.data | visitDates }}</span>
            </a>
        </li>
    {%- endfor %}
    </ul>
    <p><a href="/visits/">All visits →</a></p>
</section>

<section class="join" id="director">
    <h2>The search for a new Director</h2>
    <p>More information will appear here soon. In the meantime, feel free to <a href="/contact/">contact us</a>.</p>
</section>

